  "description": "Add bold, artistic, and mid-century charm to your designs with this Retro Floral Seamless Pattern Matisse Style Collection. Inspired by expressive shapes, abstract florals, and retro color palettes, these patterns bring a playful yet sophisticated artistic feel to modern and vintage-inspired projects.\nEach pattern is carefully designed with a clean seamless repeat, making it ideal for fabric printing, stationery, wallpaper, and print-on-demand products. The abstract floral forms and retro aesthetic create eye-catching designs perfect for art lovers and statement décor.\n👉 You will receive a total of [35] seamless patterns, all high-resolution and fully tileable for professional-quality results.\nWhat’s Included\n– [35] High-resolution seamless patterns\n– File format: JPEG (high resolution)\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px\n– Seamless and tileable for large-scale printing\n– Retro abstract floral designs inspired by modern art\n– Fully editable: resize, recolor, rotate, or layer as needed\nKey Features\n– Retro and Matisse-inspired abstract floral style\n– Bold shapes and artistic composition\n– Seamless repeating pattern format\n– High-resolution quality for print and digital use\n– Mid-century modern and contemporary aesthetic\nPerfect For\n– Fabric, textile, and wallpaper projects\n– Art-inspired home décor\n– Wrapping paper and packaging\n– Scrapbooking and art journals\n– Planner covers and stationery\n– Apparel, accessories, and merchandise\n– Print-on-demand products\n– Seamless pattern and digital paper use\nNote\nThis is a digital product. No physical items will be shipped.\nColors may vary slightly depending on monitor and printer settings.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add bold, artistic, and mid-century charm to your designs with this Retro Floral Seamless Pattern Matisse Style Collection. Inspired by expressive shapes, abstract florals, and retro color palettes, these patterns bring a playful yet sophisticated artistic feel to modern and vintage-inspired projects.</p>\n<p>Each pattern is carefully designed with a clean seamless repeat, making it ideal for fabric printing, stationery, wallpaper, and print-on-demand products. The abstract floral forms and retro aesthetic create eye-catching designs perfect for art lovers and statement décor.</p>\n<p>👉 You will receive a total of [35] seamless patterns, all high-resolution and fully tileable for professional-quality results.</p>\n<p>What’s Included</p>\n<p>– [35] High-resolution seamless patterns<br>\n– File format: JPEG (high resolution)<br>\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px<br>\n– Seamless and tileable for large-scale printing<br>\n– Retro abstract floral designs inspired by modern art<br>\n– Fully editable: resize, recolor, rotate, or layer as needed</p>\n<p>Key Features</p>\n<p>– Retro and Matisse-inspired abstract floral style<br>\n– Bold shapes and artistic composition<br>\n– Seamless repeating pattern format<br>\n– High-resolution quality for print and digital use<br>\n– Mid-century modern and contemporary aesthetic</p>\n<p>Perfect For</p>\n<p>– Fabric, textile, and wallpaper projects<br>\n– Art-inspired home décor<br>\n– Wrapping paper and packaging<br>\n– Scrapbooking and art journals<br>\n– Planner covers and stationery<br>\n– Apparel, accessories, and merchandise<br>\n– Print-on-demand products<br>\n– Seamless pattern and digital paper use</p>\n<p>Note</p>\n<p>This is a digital product. No physical items will be shipped.<br>\nColors may vary slightly depending on monitor and printer settings.</p>",
